  "ruleText": "Puc 802.15 \"System” means “system” as defined in RSA 374:48,VI, namely, “the underground facility damage prevention system referred to in RSA 374:49”.\n\nSource. #7350, eff 8-23-00; ss by #9226, INTERIM, eff 8-16-08, EXPIRES: 2-12-09; ss and moved by #9318, eff 11-8-08 (from Puc 802.14); ss by #12102, eff 2-8-17",
